- Yes Cherish, tell me

1932
01:38:11,021 --> 01:38:13,313
- I know who the mystery man is!

1933
01:38:16,063 --> 01:38:16,521
- Who?

1934
01:38:16,896 --> 01:38:17,896
- It is none other than...

1935
01:38:18,396 --> 01:38:19,313
Souparnika..!

1936
01:38:20,188 --> 01:38:20,813
- Yes!

1937
01:38:21,188 --> 01:38:23,480
If the prey finds out
who the predator is...

1938
01:38:23,646 --> 01:38:25,396
