1942
01:38:31,188 --> 01:38:32,230
Same person

1943
01:38:33,271 --> 01:38:35,771
This is called
Cluster personality disorder

1944
01:38:37,063 --> 01:38:38,146
A mental disorder

1945
01:38:38,771 --> 01:38:40,480
where a person has two or more

1946
01:38:40,980 --> 01:38:42,438
distinct personalities!

1947
01:38:42,980 --> 01:38:44,187
- She's in too much distress

1948
01:38:44,188 --> 01:38:46,979
I can't help her without knowing
all the details!

1949
01:38:46,980 --> 01:38:49,813
Please explain the case in detail

1950
01:38:50,396 --> 01:38:50,854
- Okay

1951
01:38:50,855 --> 01:38:52,021
Listen carefully

1952
01:38:52,563 --> 01:38:55,313
Souparnika studied at a boarding school

1953
01:38:55,438 --> 01:38:57,604
Since her parents were always busy

1954
01:38:57,605 --> 01:38:59,480
She became lonely

1955
01:38:59,688 --> 01:39:02,855
all her desires began to fade away

1956
01:39:03,188 --> 01:39:05,313
she didn't get anything she desired

1957
01:39:06,146 --> 01:39:07,854
Inorder keep herself happy...

1958
01:39:07,855 --> 01:39:11,271
her mind created a second personality in her

1959
01:39:11,688 --> 01:39:13,355
This Split personality...

1960
01:39:13,813 --> 01:39:16,021
knows everything about the host person

1961
01:39:16,563 --> 01:39:18,230
But that person...

1962
01:39:18,480 --> 01:39:22,146
is never aware about the new
Split personality

1963
01:39:22,521 --> 01:39:23,730
This second personality

1964
01:39:23,855 --> 01:39:25,646
steals her friend's chocolates

1965
01:39:25,771 --> 01:39:27,438
and puts it in her own bag

1966
01:39:27,688 --> 01:39:29,020
it knows that

1967
01:39:29,021 --> 01:39:31,063
Souparnika won't eat it...

1968
01:39:31,355 --> 01:39:33,145
and this personality eats it and...

1969
01:39:33,146 --> 01:39:34,355
brushes her teeth

1970
01:39:38,021 --> 01:39:39,521
She also steals...

1971
01:39:39,855 --> 01:39:41,480
